"%(n)s line(s), %(h)s h, from %(du)s to %(au)s, grouped %(par)s. The "
"statement says how much time, never how much money."
msgstr ""
"%(n)s ligne(s), %(h)s h, du %(du)s au %(au)s, regroupées %(par)s. Le relevé "
"dit combien de temps, jamais combien d'argent."

