#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_timesheet.field_federation_document__federation_statement_fingerprint
msgid ""
"The fingerprint of the timesheet statement's content. Producing the "
"statement again for the same period publishes a new version only if the "
"content changed."
msgstr ""
"L'empreinte du contenu du relevé des heures. Refaire le relevé d'une même "
"période ne publie une nouvelle version que si le contenu a changé."

#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_timesheet.field_federation_timesheet_statement__federation_peer_id
msgid ""
"The peer that receives the statement. Empty: the deliverable is prepared "
"here, without being delivered."
msgstr ""
"Le pair qui reçoit le relevé. Vide : le livrable est préparé ici, sans être "
"remis."

#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_timesheet/wizard/timesheet_statement.py:0
msgid "The period ends before it begins."
msgstr "La période finit avant de commencer."

#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_federation_timesheet/wizard/timesheet_statement.py:0
msgid "The project has no customer: a statement is delivered to someone."
msgstr "Le projet n'a pas de client : un relevé est remis à quelqu'un."

#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_federation_timesheet.view_federation_timesheet_statement_form
msgid ""
"The statement is filed as a deliverable: it carries a version, and the "
"partner acknowledges receipt. Producing the statement again for a period "
"already delivered publishes a new version, and the previous receipt drops. "
"No amount leaves."
msgstr ""
"Le relevé est déposé comme un livrable : il porte une version, et le partenaire en\n"
"                    accuse réception. Refaire le relevé d'une période déjà remise en publie une nouvelle\n"
"                    version, et l'accusé de la précédente tombe. Aucun montant ne sort."

#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_federation_timesheet.report_timesheet_statement
msgid ""
"This statement shows the time worked over the period. It carries no amount, "
"no rate and no balance."
msgstr ""
"Ce relevé dit le temps fait sur la période. Il ne porte ni montant, ni taux,"
" ni solde."

#. module: bf_federation_timesheet
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_federation_timesheet.field_federation_timesheet_statement__include_descriptions
msgid ""
"Timesheet descriptions say what was done. Untick if they carry internal "
"remarks that should not leave."
msgstr ""
"Les descriptions des lignes de temps disent ce qui a été fait. Décochez si "
"elles portent des mentions internes qui n'ont pas à sortir."

